Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 01:49:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 00899/11171] [outer-loop] SC arms run = UNDERPOWERED (unseeded
 gen + 30 eval Q -> noise dominates)

6-arm run contradicts the 3-seed on process_weighted (+0.167 here vs -0.06 across 3 seeds,
same seed) -> the GENERATION IS UNSEEDED (torch sampling not fixed), so each run trains on
different traces; with only 30 eval Q the variance swamps the small verifier/SC effects the
de-risk predicted (outcome-AUROC 0.93-0.95). Across 4 runs process_weighted = -.07/-.07/-.03/
+.17 ~ 0 +/- large. SC arms also truncation-confounded (13-17% eval). ROBUST finding holds:
GOLD teaches every run (+0.24-0.30); verifier/SC are ~base, unresolvable at this scale.
METHODOLOGY FIX for a reliable answer: SEED torch generation, eval >=100 Q, fix SC-arm eval
truncation, multi-seed. Honest verifier position unchanged: not a standalone self-improvement
reward; value is cheap-proxy + residual-catch + cascade-router.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
